Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.09,0:22:44.26,EDCHT2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}外面多麼豐富多彩（美麗）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:48.10,EDCHT2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}繽紛絢麗（美麗） 繽紛絢麗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:56.40,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}當月亮升起時 我打扮成一隻熊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.40,0:22:59.11,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}大家都是什麼樣的動物呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.11,0:23:04.36,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}我想要知道 真實的你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.87,0:23:09.49,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}大家聚在一起 軟綿綿的party
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:12.33,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}無論是小孩子還是大孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:16.67,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}ah 當你笑的時候 為我帶來了happy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:20.00,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}耳朵和尾巴都在搖晃 ho
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.00,0:23:21.76,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}毛茸 毛茸 ahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:23.55,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}驚喜 驚喜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.55,0:23:25.30,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}撫摸 撫摸 ahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.30,0:23:27.10,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}好癢 好癢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:28.72,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}毛茸 毛茸 ahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:30.52,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}驚喜 驚喜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.52,0:23:33.69,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}撫摸 撫摸 你是最棒的！
